WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.400
Governor Ivey, I've supported you both terms,

2
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.800
and I was a juror on the Mark Jenkins
capital murder case,

3
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:10.700
and I'm asking you to give him
life in prison.

4
00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:35.400
I mean, it brings up a lot of hurt,

5
00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:38.500
because I wasn't proud when I walked
out of that courthouse.

6
00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:45.300
[interviewer] Why not?

7
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:01.200
I don't think he got the right verdict.

8
00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:08.900
Sorry.
